   "text": "POLIMI Graduate School of Management - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nPOLIMI Graduate School of Management\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nPOLIMI Graduate School of Management is the Business School  of the Politecnico di Milano, one of the best scientific and technological universities in the world, which, for more than 40 years, has been engaged in providing management training programmes for graduates, professionals, companies, institutions and public administrations. Founded in 1979 as a Consortium between the Politecnico di Milano and a number of important Italian institutions and companies, today POLIMI GSoM is a non-for-profit consortium limited company.  \nThe school works every day to maximise its positive impact on society, exploiting and spreading the power of digital innovation, relationships and multiculturalism.\nOur portfolio of master programmes, focusing on specific areas of management, include Master courses targeting fresh graduates or graduates with limited working experience, and Executive Masters offered to managers and executives. The more specialized nature of a Master provides the candidate with the precise academic and theoretical framework to work in a specific management function.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n18/05/2026 11:08\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n18/11/2024 10:37\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nItaly\nYearly Fees\nMax: €50,000.00\nMin: €19,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n60%\n240 of 400 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1979\nCampus(es)\nMilano\nCountry\nItaly\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n06/11/2024\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.gsom.polimi.it/en/fees-benefits-junior-specialising-masters/\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=alvzexlZqIo\n https://www.youtube.com/c/POLIMIGraduateSchoolofManagement\nInternship Details\nhttps://www.gsom.polimi.it/en/for-companies/\nAdditional Information\nApplication Fee- EURO 100 (For Masters)\nApplication Fee- EURO 150 (For MBA)",
